cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Second Look: AI Safety Test Inspector"
message: "If you use this tool or its findings, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Cirello
    given-names: Joseph
    affiliation: Potestas AI
repository-code: "https://github.com/Potestas-AI/second-look"
url: "https://potestasai.com"
abstract: >-
  An inspector for the inspectors. Second Look reads the result file written by promptfoo, garak or Inspect
  and reports whether the safety score on it can be trusted: answers passed without being graded, refusal
  words matched inside other words, blank answers that were graded, and runs that stopped early. It runs no
  test and calls no model.
keywords:
  - AI safety
  - LLM evaluation
  - red teaming
  - promptfoo
  - garak
  - Inspect
  - AI agents
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-11-27"
